.SS "int32_t schultz_events_set_focus (\fBschultz_events\fP * events, \fBschultz_handle\fP node)"

.PP
Moves keyboard focus to a node\&. Emits focus lost on the previous holder and focus gained on the new one, and maintains SCHULTZ_STATE_FOCUSED, which marks both dirty\&. Passing SCHULTZ_HANDLE_NONE clears focus\&.
